{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":158339,\"title\":\"Three Sisters\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Once upon a time in a beautiful yet mysterious country, there lived three sisters named Türkan, Dönüş, and Derya. As a close-knit family, they would dream of a promising future every night. Perhaps such an upbringing, that was similar to a fairy tale on the pine-scented streets of Ayvalık, had not prepared them for the grim reality of adulthood. Over time, the sisters discover that life and the choices that are accompanied by it are not as easy as they seem. Inconceivable secrets can be hidden even by those who are trusted the most and horrific illnesses can lead to the resurrection of the past. This leads them to the question: Is there anything in the world that time cannot heal?\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3kaHac8zpJykxVdXM6Fse3AYj9W.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gCLhbOZJaYv5HjKMU4aMntLMUQs.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":6.8,\"voteCount\":10,\"year\":2022,\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":3,\"totalEpisodes\":84,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"Kanal D\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"TR\",\"name\":\"Turkey\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2024-05-04\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2380655,\"name\":\"Eda Teksöz\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1953639,\"name\":\"İclal Aydın\",\"character\":\"Nesrin\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uMGVUAcSAOfeKc40EdRZnRUkQSt.jpg\"},{\"id\":1109362,\"name\":\"Reha Özcan\",\"character\":\"Sadık\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gabSe1RiXKvCXy6X7amM9Y2cjue.jpg\"},{\"id\":1829150,\"name\":\"Almila Ada\",\"character\":\"Dönüş\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bXd8deX72g5XJG5mep3mmJqtVpP.jpg\"},{\"id\":1935666,\"name\":\"Berker Güven\",\"character\":\"Somer\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7oROmKqz1Wr5JaYll5NcPzPztfX.jpg\"},{\"id\":1513948,\"name\":\"Benian Dönmez\",\"character\":\"Nezahat Kalender\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g2GBuyrOGTiEMnD3C93VvmKHwcq.jpg\"},{\"id\":2755808,\"name\":\"Nazlı Senem Ünal\",\"character\":\"Mine\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Ap7j8toM1xZQEww89wmPEJigAWE.jpg\"},{\"id\":1372946,\"name\":\"Hakan Atalay\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5ivj7W6frBCQ2J5YOsf3WcK235r.jpg\"},{\"id\":3458974,\"name\":\"Vural Şahanoğlu\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gEPb908qaQfGDMxstVQttZhwj6q.jpg\"},{\"id\":1985839,\"name\":\"Emre Kıvılcım\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k6RjYtWACMqh5Rzvfkm2bzQOhrm.jpg\"},{\"id\":1256380,\"name\":\"Veda Yurtsever\",\"character\":\"Rüçhan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sL6mehnVbf4FX3vwvZa1gvfTljO.jpg\"},{\"id\":2058369,\"name\":\"Serhan Süsler\",\"character\":\"Nihat\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AryjuWltOnHNCcubLia6cJOq4mO.jpg\"},{\"id\":1954011,\"name\":\"Özgü Kaya\",\"character\":\"Türkan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1gWd5zxYiefY5xu2avh5BPzcz4R.jpg\"},{\"id\":3505664,\"name\":\"Demircan Kaçel\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kvZxq44fZ0QO6hSZqFBPymNHhw6.jpg\"},{\"id\":3557953,\"name\":\"Melisa Berberoğlu\",\"character\":\"Derya\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4qmMSnFum4k5XA7Xt7nUBTNrn6j.jpg\"},{\"id\":3289116,\"name\":\"Murat Çidamlı\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p9b1iLdCKNwzhqBdp4S4aPiQz2G.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"sXM_p_aQo40\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"XUA8tUW8ty4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"vZmzIMAdXAU\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[],\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Season 3\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qOxdgxdoRC79cR09s4fqNptHuPl.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2023-09-19\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Episode 54\",\"overview\":\"The Kalender family is now like a plane tree whose branches have been hit by a storm. The traffic accident that Sadık and Nesrin had together was the turning point in the lives of the three sisters. These days, they do not even greet each other. On the other side, Türkan has healed the wounds of her losses with Kartal, but even though she cannot admit it even to herself, her heart and soul belong to Somer. Somer, who lives in Scotland with his daughter, knocks on Türkan's door unexpectedly.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-09-19\",\"runtime\":154},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Episode 55\",\"overview\":\"“I promise you, Ms. Nesrin. I will collect the scattered pearls one by one and hang them around your neck again.\\\" That's what Rüçhan promised at Nesrin's grave. Now she would do her best to keep her promise. That's why she gave an invitation to reconcile the three sisters and to gather around a table again, just like before. Türkan was going through very difficult times, with her brother's illness on the one hand and preparations for the wedding on the other. Somer's arrival shook her heart and soul, and she didn't know what to do. Will she get married with Kartal or will she accept Ms. Rüçhan's invitation and open a new page with Somer? On the other hand, Somer also suspected that there might be a relationship between Türkan and Kartal and pursued the matter.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-09-26\",\"runtime\":148},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Episode 56\",\"overview\":\"Türkan's participation in the dinner gave Somer hope again. Derya and Dön met again years later at the Kormans' invitation. Sadık is still angry with Derya, but he was able to love his grandson Özer Efe from afar, even if only with his eyes. On the other hand, Kartal did not want to hide his situation with Türkan from anyone, and Türkan wanted it to remain secret.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-03\",\"runtime\":143},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 57\",\"overview\":\"Somer is furious that Türkan took Kiraz to Mine, and when he goes to Türkan's house to settle the score, there is great tension between the two. But no matter what happens, a new hope for Türkan blossoms in Somer. For Kartal, Somer's presence around them is a great threat to his marriage. Although he tries not to let Türkan feel this, problems begin to arise in their marriage. Serdar sees his wife, whom he is about to leave, as Dönüş's doctor. Although he makes great efforts to prevent Dönüş from feeling this, he has a hard time because of his ongoing marriage. Dönüş also starts to have difficulty hiding her illness from her father and her family. Mustafa is undecided about moving to the Kormanlar mansion. He does not want to leave his mother. However, this is an opportunity for Derya. She does her best to convince Mustafa about it. Rüçhan continues to encourage her son to get Somer and Türkan back together. Kartal decides to save his marriage and not to lose Türkan.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-10\",\"runtime\":135},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 58\",\"overview\":\"Somer cannot control his anger when he learns that Türkan and Kartal are getting married. On the other hand, Rüçhan uses Derya to let Sadık learn about Türkan's marriage, despite Somer. This causes new tension between Derya and the Kalender family. Feeling guilty, Ayla tells Rüçhan Hanım that the marriage between Kartal and Türkan is only on paper and that they are not really husband and wife. However, this statement causes Somer and Türkan to go down a path of no return. Somer's next battle will be to win back his daughter, Defne, and Türkan.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-17\",\"runtime\":137},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 59\",\"overview\":\"Even though Somer kidnapped Türkan for custody of Defne, there is an unexpected rapprochement between the two. Will this be a love game or the beginning of a truth that both parties will have to face? Sevilay turns this situation into an opportunity and confronts Kartal. Kartal, who is eagerly waiting for Türkan, goes after them with great anger when he finds out that she is with Somer. He starts working at the hospital where Serdar Dönn is treated. He gets stuck in a corner regarding Aylin. There is a big showdown between Sadık and Kartal when he learns that his daughter is getting married. Kartal doesn't stop there and goes to Rüçhan's house. He asks for an account. Türkan and Somer make a decision in the house they are staying in, but they are unaware of the danger that awaits them.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-24\",\"runtime\":143},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 60\",\"overview\":\"Unable to digest what he sees, Kartal cannot accept defeat and takes action. Türkan takes a difficult decision to protect Somer and puts it into practice. Sadık, impressed by his conversation with Müjgan, thinks about his fatherhood and learns that he must accept his children with their sins and good deeds. He embraces both Türkan and Derya. The meeting of father and daughters will make us feel the feeling of being a family again, deep down to our bones. Because family means fighting together under all circumstances.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-31\",\"runtime\":143},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 61\",\"overview\":\"Will Kartal, in pursuit of justice, continue to condemn Türkan to captivity? Although the Korman Family tries to get their lives back on track after Somer regains his freedom and takes custody of Defne, they begin to lose their power as Korman Zeytincilik. Turkan was shaken by the custody of her daughter and faced losing everything by succumbing to her anger while pursuing this case. Turkan's daughter? Her love? Or will she pursue her freedom? After declaring bankruptcy, Mustafa receives an offer that is the opportunity of a lifetime. Meanwhile, things may not go well for Derya. While struggling with return sickness, she finds herself in a state of disappointment once again.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-07\",\"runtime\":144},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Episode 62\",\"overview\":\"Özer and Somer, who have not heard from Rüçhan for a long time, start to worry. They start investigating the police station and hospitals and are shocked by the painful news. Türkan cannot tell the truth for fear of losing her daughter. On the other hand, dark clouds hang over the Kalender family. On perhaps the happiest day of her last years, Dönüş learns that Serdar is married and is undecided whether to continue the rest of her treatment. While Somer goes after the person who did this evil to his mother, the circle narrows for Türkan. She feels compelled to choose between confessing her guilt and running away with her daughter. Torn between her conscience and motherhood, what will Türkan decide?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-14\",\"runtime\":149},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Episode 63\",\"overview\":\"Despite everything, even though she is afraid of what will happen, Türkan listens to her heart and returns to Somer. On the other hand, while Rüçhan's awakening turns into a joy for the Korman family, it turns into an inextricable nightmare for Türkan. Somer is pursuing the person who did this evil to his mother, step by step. Turkan, cornered, talks to Kartal. Kartal's attitude towards this incident is clear. While Dönüş is struggling with the heartbreak left behind by Serdar; Uzay supports it. She does her best to continue her treatment. Unable to bear the pressure and humiliation from Mustafa and Derya, she makes a new decision. While dreaming of reuniting with Somer, Türkan's fears of Rüçhan are growing more and more every moment.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-21\",\"runtime\":146},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Episode 64\",\"overview\":\"When the police take away Türkan, Somer thinks for the first time, \\\"Did Türkan do it?\\\". When he puts all the pieces together, the possibility that the woman he loves is the murderer of his mother hurts Somer a lot. Türkan, on the other hand, thinks that she has reached the end of the road. Rüçhan offers Kartal a deal to make his plan work. On the other hand, a dinner is organized for Müjgan in the Kalender family. Müjgan's arrival at the dinner blows cold winds in Dönüş's heart. It is revealed that it was Sevilay who sent the wedding photos that caused Nesrin's death. This causes tensions between Derya and Mustafa.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-28\",\"runtime\":153},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Episode 65\",\"overview\":\"On the morning of a dreamlike night, Türkan and Somer wake up to reality with a letter from Sadık. While Sadık is unaware that he has brought Türkan's edict, Somer is confronted with the fact that it was Türkan who did this evil to his mother. Somer is angry, not knowing how to deal with this reality. With his departure, Mustafa has taken his revenge on everyone he left behind. As Kartal tracks Mustafa's trail, Mustafa's escape puts the Korman family in a difficult situation. With Mustafa's departure, Derya is on the verge of a new decision. Will justice or Somer's conscience punish Türkan?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-12-05\",\"runtime\":151},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Episode 66\",\"overview\":\"While Türkan is pursuing her own justice, Somer has thrown her into heavier emotional bondage by turning her off the path. Along with this bondage, Somer becomes uneasy with what he has done and starts to fight with himself. Rüçhan, on the other hand, has realized her insidious plan for Türkan and seeks ruthless revenge. On the other hand, Kartal presents his proposal that will bring the end of Kormanlar Zeytincilik. However, Somer will not give in to Kartal's manipulations through Mustafa. Even though Serdar thinks that he has lost Dönüş, he tries to prevent Uzay's journey to win Dönüş. While struggling with the troubles of his daughters, Sadık falls into an emotional void. He finds solace in Müjgan, whom he sees as a good friend. As Rüçhan goes further with her revenge plan, seeing Türkan's pain and using Somer's name, this situation turns into an unbearable torment of conscience for Somer.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-12-12\",\"runtime\":148},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Episode 67\",\"overview\":\"Realizing the game Rüçhan played on Türkan, Somer is determined to protect Türkan from Rüçhan. Even if Özer talks to Rüçhan not to continue this game, it will be of no use. While Kartal is pursuing new plans for Korman Olive Farming, dark clouds begin to descend on the Korman family. Derya has charted the path of her new life. Not getting the response he expected from Dönüş , Uzay continues to move forward with wrong steps. While Rüçhan tries to make Türkan pay for her past, will she face an unexpected end?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-12-19\",\"runtime\":142},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Episode 68\",\"overview\":\"As the Kormans are shaken by Rüçhan's suicide, Türkan realizes that Rüçhan's suicide attempt is rooted in her past. She mentions this to Somer, and together, they start to trace the past that hurt Rüçhan. On the other hand, Rüçhan starts to take steps for his family and himself while being stuck in his past. As the Kormanlar Zeytincilik slowly starts to bleed, Türkan and Somer promise each other to stay strong and become a family again. On the Dönüş and Uzay front, Dönüş visits Uzay after receiving a phone call from Müjgan. When Serdar finds out about this visit, he does not take it well and has a problem with Dönüş, but Serdar then decisively goes to talk to Sadık for a good deed. When the Kalender family gathers for Dönüş and Serdar, they face an unexpected threat.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-12-26\",\"runtime\":145},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Episode 69\",\"overview\":\"When Uzay's love turns into desperation and his desperation turns into anger; It casts a shadow on Serdar and Dönüş's request ceremony and the Kalenders' house. Müjgan is both saddened by his son's actions and embarrassed towards Sadık. Dönüş, on the other hand, thinks that she is responsible for what happened. Adnan's arrival in Ayvalık makes Rüçhan uneasy, and on the Kartal side, this visit is considered surprising but normal. Rüçhan asks Müjgan for help to find out the reason for his brother's arrival. On the other hand, Somer tries to find out the reason for his uncle's arrival and follows the traces of his son, whom his mother thinks is dead. While Türkan has solved the secret in her own way and shares her mind with Somer, Kartal confronts Adnan. But what Somer hears next will be a great disappointment for him.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-01-09\",\"runtime\":148},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Episode 70\",\"overview\":\"Somer learns the painful truth from Rüçhan's past and is shaken. While Rüçhan continues to search for her son's existence, Müjgan tries to help her but fails. On the other hand, Somer continues to trace his brother's footsteps. Kartal, now aware of the blood connection between Adnan and Rüçhan, becomes even more uneasy. Türkan, feeling emotional towards Rüçhan and trying to empathize with Somer's sadness, is aware of Somer's distance. To boost morale, she makes a beautiful plan, but Somer is in a confused state. What will Somer's response be to Türkan's surprise?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-01-16\",\"runtime\":144},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Episode 71\",\"overview\":\"While Rüçhan was under the influence of what she heard from Adnan, Somer did not want his mother to know the truth. Maybe he was thinking of using Kartal and Adnan's closeness as a shield for his mother. While Türkan was not comfortable with all this, she argued that Rüçhan should learn the truth. Adnan, on the other hand, is well aware that Kartal is now close to this secret, and tries to keep Kartal away from the issues with his lies. While new steps are being taken on the Serdar and Dönüş's front, Uzay tries to deceive his mother again by pursuing tricks. While the Korman family has become a little happier with Türkan's surprise for the children, misfortunes will follow them again. While Kartal pursues his suspicions, how long will Somer hide the facts he knows? How will Kartal deal with the facts he hears?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-01-23\",\"runtime\":139},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Episode 72\",\"overview\":\"While Kartal is shocked by what he heard from Derya, the Korman family is now completely defeated and torn apart. While the Kormans have completely lost their wealth and power, doors that Rüçhan would not stoop to will open their doors to her. On the other hand, Rüçhan is longingly waiting for news from her son. While Kartal is trying to take care of his mother and continues to be filled by Adnan, he is still unable to cope with this reality. Even though Adnan is afraid of losing Kartal, he takes advantage of this situation. While Somer struggles for his family, he will realize a little late that he left behind Türkan.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-01-30\",\"runtime\":149},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"Episode 73\",\"overview\":\"While Rüçhan cannot find any trace of her son yet, Kartal promises Rüçhan to bring his son. Somer, who learned his lesson after Türkan got sick, started to act more intelligently and, through Türkan's help, first went to talk to his father in order to learn the facts, went after the corruption, and decided to save his father. The seeds of impossible love have already been planted on Derya and Kartal's side, and as they try to stay away from each other under the influence of what happened, they come to a dead end. Türkan starts to become very worried about Derya. Will the black-covered notebook that emerges as Sevilay and Adnan's collaboration continues be Özer's exit ticket? Or will it create new problems for Adnan?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-02-06\",\"runtime\":145},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"Episode 74\",\"overview\":\"While Somer holds his father's exit ticket in his hand, Adnan is faced with paying the price for his sins, and with all his usual anger, he does not stop making moves. Rüçhan and Somer come face to face with losing Özer through Adnan's various tricks. On the other hand, Somer's steps to save his family will disappoint Türkan about the new house. As Rüçhan gets closer to her son step by step, will Kartal succumb to the feelings he has never experienced and wants to experience? Will Adnan be able to keep his son Kartal, whom he does not want to lose, away from Rüçhan?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-02-17\",\"runtime\":138},{\"number\":22,\"name\":\"Episode 75\",\"overview\":\"While Rüçhan found her son, she faces losing him again. She tries to keep her son alive, whom she thought was dead. On the other hand, although Rüçhan tells Somer what she went through as if she were confessing, will Somer be able to accept this situation? Derya's concern for Kartal begins to concern Somer and Türkan. Although Adnan seems to have disappeared after what happened, he will leave Müjgan in a difficult situation as he plans to go to Müjgan and hide under threat. Then, when he knocks on Kartal's door again, Adnan confronts Rüçhan and will continue to test Rüçhan with his children.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-02-24\",\"runtime\":143},{\"number\":23,\"name\":\"Episode 76\",\"overview\":\"Adnan asks Rüçhan to choose between her two sons, but things will not go as Adnan planned. Kartal may succumb to his feelings for Adnan and make a wrong decision. Will Kartal and Somer come face to face as a result of this wrong decision? On the other hand, Müjgan's arrival at home causes tension in the Kalender family. Girls do not want to accept this situation. Three sisters make some decisions about their father's relationship at their mother's grave. Derya and Kartal's relationship has become more intense. New developments occur on the Türkan and Somer front. Although starting from scratch feels good for both of them, Rüçhan continues to take decisive steps to get closer to Kartal, while Somer cannot share his mother and will continue to reject this closeness without approving it. Rüçhan's confession may not be welcomed by his family.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-02\",\"runtime\":148},{\"number\":24,\"name\":\"Episode 77\",\"overview\":\"Rüçhan has now announced to everyone that she is Kartal's nother, but this causes a rift between her and Özer. Özer will not accept Kartal. After all that happened, Kartal decides to leave Ayvalık, even though he is impressed by Rüçhan's open-hearted behavior. Derya shares this situation with Rüçhan, and Rüçhan desperately searches for a solution. Years later, she found her son and does not want to lose him, but she is now aware of Derya and Kartal's relationship. While the three sisters do not approve of their father's relationship, Sadık makes an unexpected move in response to the girls' move. Even though Somer and Kartal cooperate against Adnan, will Özer's pressure on Somer cause Somer to take wrong steps?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-09\",\"runtime\":148},{\"number\":25,\"name\":\"Episode 78\",\"overview\":\"Kartal, who had organized to catch Adnan, finds his plans turned upside down when Derya goes to the meeting place. Witnessing the closeness between Derya and Kartal, Somer's collaboration with Kartal is cast into doubt. While Derya worries for Kartal, Kartal's future now rests between Somer's hands. Sadık and Müjgan have formalized their relationship. Despite the girls' continued opposition, Rüçhan will learn the truth about this relationship from Müjgan. On the other hand, the girls have plans to dissuade their fathers from this marriage. Adnan's capture will lead to positive developments for the Korman family.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-16\",\"runtime\":139},{\"number\":26,\"name\":\"Episode 79\",\"overview\":\"Kartal completely changes his plans for the future with the good news he receives from Derya. However, Derya has hesitations. Sadık is shocked by what is being said about Derya. On the other hand, Sevilay informs Özer about Kartal and Derya's relationship. Sevilay's step may bring Derya is on the brink of separating from her son. How will their fathers react to Derya and Kartal's relationship? Will Sevilay be able to achieve her goal? The developments in Müjgan's life alarm Cevriye and the girls, and they start to investigate Müjgan. They think she is playing a trick on Sadık. While Somer makes a new proposal for Türkan, the developments in Derya and Kartal's relationship will infuriate Türkan.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-23\",\"runtime\":138},{\"number\":27,\"name\":\"Episode 80\",\"overview\":\"Sadık's approval of Derya and Kartal's marriage infuriates Türkan. Türkan makes an impulsive decision and requests a medical report for her father. Learning about Türkan's move, Sadık turns away from his daughter. Serdar worries about Dönüş's relapse and tries to prevent her from meeting her family. This situation causes conflict between Serdar and Dönüş. Efe, who learns about Derya's pregnancy, will cause trouble for his mother. Türkan's reaction to Derya and Kartal's relationship causes a misunderstanding between Rüçhan and Somer. Somer will have to offer Türkan a choice about their relationship in the face of this situation.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-03-30\",\"runtime\":139},{\"number\":28,\"name\":\"Episode 81\",\"overview\":\"As tension builds between Somer and Türkan, Efe goes missing. While Sadık tries to find Efe, Kartal and Derya come to help. Efe is finally found and delivered to Derya. As Sevilay and Özer go to look for a house, Kartal offers Sevilay money, but Özer refuses. When Derya announces that she is pregnant, Türkan transfers her shares to Derya. As tension builds between Sadık and Müjgan, the house catches fire, and Türkan and Somer are trapped in the flames.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-06\",\"runtime\":138},{\"number\":29,\"name\":\"Episode 82\",\"overview\":\"Derya and Kartal's wedding day has arrived, but everyone is shocked by the news of the fire Özer started. What Rüçhan thought was a victory turns into a struggle for life between Türkan and Somer in the flames. Sevilay tries to take advantage of Özer and Rüçhan's anger towards each other. She will use Müjgan to further her plans. The girls' suspicion of Müjgan could damage her relationship with Sadık. However, things will not go as planned for Sevilay.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-20\",\"runtime\":143},{\"number\":30,\"name\":\"Episode 83\",\"overview\":\"Müjgan's actions will be the beginning of an irreversible path for Sadık. The girls feel like they have triumphed because they show their father Müjgan's true face. On the other hand, Sevilay falls into the trap of the game she played. She will now be condemned to live exactly what she deserves. Although this situation relieves Derya, she is unaware of what will happen to her. While Türkan and Somer are in a sweet wedding rush, Dönüş's sudden decision gives Serdar a big shock. Sadık tries to struggle with the weight of his experiences. While trying to bring his daughters together and bring them closer, he endangers his own health.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-27\",\"runtime\":146},{\"number\":31,\"name\":\"Episode 84\",\"overview\":\"Sadık's sudden illness caused a great shock to the family. Sadık's illness brings the three sisters together again. This may be their last story together. Derya and Kartal decide to leave quickly, worried that Mustafa is coming. On the other hand, Dönüş is aware that she has been unfair to Serdar and that she cannot be without him. For Türkan and Somer, the door of happiness now opens to eternity. They are excited to say yes to the wedding they dreamed of. Years passed, and although everyone licked their wounds and wrote their own stories, they managed to become a family.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-05-04\",\"runtime\":145}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2022-02-22\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}